      "content": "it just feels like more than just being \"awake.\" it feels like i'm just exhausted. the \"letting go\" part sounds nice in theory, but if nothing matters, then why even bother staying for the next moment? it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen that'll never happen. why is the default always to just keep struggling through?",
